title: An extension's tree views open from its icon as a card of lists that expand, run commands and refresh
folders: rust-small
extensions: views-extension
expect-log: the tree qa\.items shows 3 rows at its root
expect-log: script: tree qa\.items: > Fruits / v Vegetables /   carrot /   leek / Read me
expect-log: script: tree qa\.notes: first note / second note
expect-log: script: tree qa\.items: v Fruits /   banana /   cherry /   damson / v Vegetables
forbid-log: qa\.hidden
expect-file: rust-small/qa-ran.txt :: expanded Fruits
expect-file: rust-small/qa-ran.txt :: open banana
expect-file: rust-small/qa-ran.txt :: remove apple
expect-file: rust-small/qa-ran.txt :: add damson
expect-file: rust-small/qa-ran.txt :: run readme

wait 3000
right qa.fake-views
wait 2500
tree report
mark tree
wait 600
tree Fruits
wait 1200
mark tree-open
wait 600
ui move 1450 146
wait 500
mark tree-row-buttons
wait 600
ui move 1450 100
wait 500
mark tree-title-buttons
wait 600
ui move 900 600
tree banana
tree Read me
tree button qa.items.remove apple
wait 1200
tree title qa.items.add
wait 1500
tree report
mark tree-changed
wait 600
quit
